      "sourceTextSha256": "135c38e6256d6b7af1897debf12414ac91b1d7d8ff1ad9d17222b0704baaa58e",
      "text": "Day 6: Free Day\n\nToday you’ll visit the Pemón indigenous community, enjoy a musical performance, shop for local handicrafts, and sample traditional cuisine — such as ant sauce, Moriche palm caterpillars, and cassava bread (casabe) made from yucca.\n\nMeals: Breakfast, lunch, dinner\n\nOptional excursions:\n\nVisit to the Kavac Canyon and a scenic flight over Angel Falls (half-day)\n\nHelicopter tour to Angel Falls (1 hour)\n\nBlue Lagoon (3 hours)\n\nBlue Lagoon & hike to Kuravaina Tepui (full day)\n\nSakaika Waterfall by bicycle (half-day)",
      "provenance": {
