      "sourceTextSha256": "a23b87de9dfe8deda701d9f2162e1b900d2333090f830f2bb94cb8054aec84b2",
      "text": "Day 7: Margarita Island\n\nBreakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the airport. Flight to Caracas and connection to Margarita Island.\n\nMeet and transfer to the all-inclusive hotel.\n\nMeals: Breakfast, dinner\n\nEnjoy a relaxing stay on the Pearl of the Caribbean — Margarita Island, famous for its pristine tropical beaches, vibrant atmosphere, and year-round sunshine.\n\nThanks to its geographical position, Margarita is the southernmost of the Caribbean resort islands.",
